    2348   00:4D68  20 0D                   jr  nz,DO_EXTBIO3SSH
    2349   00:4D6A  E1                      pop hl
    2350   00:4D6B  CD 42 5E                call    GETSLTT                 ; GETSLTT is GETSLT that checks if our memory area @ HIMEM has been allocated, if not, allocate it
