    2790   00:4F5D  CD 1D 4E                call    TCPIP_GENERIC_CHECK_TIME_OUT
    2791   00:4F60  18 F4                   jr  TCPIP_GET_CAPAB_BLK3_ST3
    2792   00:4F62                      TCPIP_GET_CAPAB_BLK3_ST3.1:
