    4986   00:5A9C                          ; now oti the data starting at hl, size is in DE
    4987   00:5A9C                          ; Grauw Optimized 16 bit loop, handy for us, mostly since we can use outi :-D
    4988   00:5A9C  43                      ld  b,e                         ;Number of loops originaly in DE
