    5071   00:5AFD                          ; now oti the data starting at hl, size is in DE
    5072   00:5AFD                          ; Grauw Optimized 16 bit loop, handy for us, mostly since we can use outi :-D
    5073   00:5AFD  43                      ld  b,e                         ;Number of loops originaly in DE
    5074   00:5AFE  1B                      dec de
